  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7350201",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "735020101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "735020101": {
            "id": "735020101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Bulletin Board",
            "text": "\"In the light of alternating day cycles, one can see the homeward figure of the lighthouse on the bridge.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735020102"
            ]
          },
          "735020102": {
            "id": "735020102",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wh—What is this...? A riddle? Or a proverb or something...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735020103"
            ]
          },
          "735020103": {
            "id": "735020103",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Alternating day cycles? Homeward figure...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735020104"
            ]
          },
          "735020104": {
            "id": "735020104",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Kamal",
            "text": "Hello, traveler. Are you interested in Drusus's riddle too?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735020107"
            ]
          },
          "735020107": {
            "id": "735020107",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Kamal",
            "text": "It was set up by an Akademiya researcher named Drusus.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735020108"
            ]
          },
          "735020108": {
            "id": "735020108",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Kamal",
            "text": "As far as I know, he's an eccentric even among the Akademiya crowd.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735020109"
            ]
          },
          "735020109": {
            "id": "735020109",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Kamal",
            "text": "He loves to talk about riddles with anyone, as well as research all kinds of encryption methods.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735020110"
            ]
          },
          "735020110": {
            "id": "735020110",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Kamal",
            "text": "But some of his riddles are too incomprehensible, so not many people are willing to deal with him.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735020111"
            ]
          },
          "735020111": {
            "id": "735020111",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Kamal",
            "text": "So he came up with the \"solve riddles for prizes\" idea.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735020112"
            ]
          },
          "735020112": {
            "id": "735020112",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Kamal",
            "text": "Simply put, this riddle actually hints at a treasure trove.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735020113"
            ]
          },
          "735020113": {
            "id": "735020113",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Kamal",
            "text": "You just have to show up at the right place at the right time using the right method and you'll get the treasure.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735020114"
            ]
          },
          "735020114": {
            "id": "735020114",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Kamal",
            "text": "Drusus also gave a hint, saying that the locations are all within Sumeru City.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735020115"
            ]
          },
          "735020115": {
            "id": "735020115",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Kamal",
            "text": "But as you can see, no adventurer has been able to succeed.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735020116"
            ]
          },
          "735020116": {
            "id": "735020116",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Kamal",
            "text": "You can certainly try if you're interested.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735020117"
            ]
          },
          "735020117": {
            "id": "735020117",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Kamal",
            "text": "But if you ask me, I'd tell you to do something else more productive..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7350207",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "735020701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "735020701": {
            "id": "735020701",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "This really is the place. \"The sole path to knowledge\" are these bridges.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735020702"
            ]
          },
          "735020702": {
            "id": "735020702",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "There's a note in here too... Is this chain of riddles still not over?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735020703"
            ]
          },
          "735020703": {
            "id": "735020703",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Let Paimon see. This says...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735020704"
            ]
          },
          "735020704": {
            "id": "735020704",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "\"Brilliant colors are blooming, with watery pearls there lingering.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735020705"
            ]
          },
          "735020705": {
            "id": "735020705",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Wh—What does it mean!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735020706"
            ]
          },
          "735020706": {
            "id": "735020706",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon thinks it's describing some kind of flower, but what does \"with watery pearls there lingering\" mean...?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7350208",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "735020801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "735020801": {
            "id": "735020801",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So it really is talking about lotuses. Now that Paimon thinks about it... Those leaves do seem to hold \"watery pearls\"...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735020802"
            ]
          },
          "735020802": {
            "id": "735020802",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "There's a note here too...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735020803"
            ]
          },
          "735020803": {
            "id": "735020803",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "\"Please go to the front door of the Temple of Knowledge at noon.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735020804"
            ]
          },
          "735020804": {
            "id": "735020804",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "This is quite direct. Paimon thought it was gonna be another riddle.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735020805"
            ]
          },
          "735020805": {
            "id": "735020805",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ugh... Whatever. Let's just do what this says and go to the front door of the Temple of Knowledge at noon."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7350209",
