    {
      "subId": "7350205",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "735020501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "735020501": {
            "id": "735020501",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "\"Noon, after eating breakfast, when daylight shifts with daylight.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735020502"
            ]
          },
          "735020502": {
            "id": "735020502",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So... this means \"go to the top of the lighthouse at noon\"!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735020503"
            ]
          },
          "735020503": {
            "id": "735020503",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon worked so hard! It's actually so easy!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735020504"
            ]
          },
          "735020504": {
            "id": "735020504",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Never mind, it's all good as long as the treasure is found... Let's see what's in the chest.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735020505"
            ]
          },
          "735020505": {
            "id": "735020505",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "There's a note here too...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735020506"
            ]
          },
          "735020506": {
            "id": "735020506",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh? What does it say? Let Paimon see.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735020507"
            ]
          },
          "735020507": {
            "id": "735020507",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "\"A mirror not made of glass reflects every drama.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735020508"
            ]
          },
          "735020508": {
            "id": "735020508",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Is this hinting at the next treasure location?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735020509"
            ]
          },
          "735020509": {
            "id": "735020509",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "It mentions \"drama\" so does it mean the treasure location has to do with \"theater\"?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735020510"
            ]
          },
          "735020510": {
            "id": "735020510",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon doesn't understand... But it feels like it's hinting at an amazing place."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7350206",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "735020601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "735020601": {
            "id": "735020601",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "\"A mirror not made of glass reflects every drama.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735020602"
            ]
          },
          "735020602": {
            "id": "735020602",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Reflects every drama... So it meant this theater...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735020603"
            ]
          },
          "735020603": {
            "id": "735020603",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "A mirror not made of glass... So it meant the pond behind the theater...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735020604"
            ]
          },
          "735020604": {
            "id": "735020604",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "This place isn't amazing at all! Why use such an impressive riddle to describe such an ordinary place?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735020605"
            ]
          },
          "735020605": {
            "id": "735020605",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "There's a note in here too.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735020606"
            ]
          },
          "735020606": {
            "id": "735020606",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "A riddle again? Is this a serial riddle...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735020607"
            ]
          },
          "735020607": {
            "id": "735020607",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "\"The sole path to knowledge.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735020608"
            ]
          },
          "735020608": {
            "id": "735020608",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "This looks... not that difficult...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735020609"
            ]
          },
          "735020609": {
            "id": "735020609",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "The only place that can represent knowledge in Sumeru City must be there..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7350203",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "735020301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "735020301": {
            "id": "735020301",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Drusus",
            "text": "Is no one coming today either...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735020302"
            ]
          },
          "735020302": {
            "id": "735020302",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Is this the \"front door of the Temple of Knowledge\"?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735020303"
            ]
          },
          "735020303": {
            "id": "735020303",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Drusus",
            "text": "That's right! This is the front door of the Temple of Knowledge. You seem to have solved all my riddles.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735020304"
            ]
          },
          "735020304": {
            "id": "735020304",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Drusus",
            "text": "And that's wonderful! I thought no one would be able to do that today either! Actually, I'm going back to have lunch soon...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735020305"
            ]
          },
          "735020305": {
            "id": "735020305",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Why did you write these riddles?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735020306"
            ]
          },
          "735020306": {
            "id": "735020306",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Drusus",
            "text": "Because it's fun, of course.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735020307"
            ]
          },
          "735020307": {
            "id": "735020307",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That was a quick answer!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735020308"
            ]
          },
          "735020308": {
            "id": "735020308",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Drusus",
            "text": "Other than that reason, why do you think I wrote down these riddles?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735020309"
            ]
          },
          "735020309": {
            "id": "735020309",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Drusus",
            "text": "Did you think that I was just enjoying being difficult?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735020312"
            ]
          },
          "735020312": {
            "id": "735020312",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Drusus",
            "text": "Hahaha, then you have misunderstood me, like some people in the Akademiya.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735020313"
            ]
          },
          "735020313": {
            "id": "735020313",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Drusus",
            "text": "I wrote these riddles down because I simply enjoy the feeling of pondering that comes with puzzling them out.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735020314"
            ]
          },
          "735020314": {
            "id": "735020314",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Drusus",
            "text": "When you look back at my riddles, you can see that there is always a keyword leading to the final answer.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735020315"
            ]
          },
          "735020315": {
            "id": "735020315",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Drusus",
            "text": "If you use this keyword as a base and keep thinking about it, the final answer will gradually present itself.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735020316"
            ]
          },
          "735020316": {
            "id": "735020316",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Drusus",
            "text": "If I'd simply wanted to make things difficult for others, I would erase all the clues and turn the riddle into a truly unsolvable problem.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735020317"
            ]
          },
          "735020317": {
            "id": "735020317",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Drusus",
            "text": "Let's not talk about this now. Since you've solved all my riddles, you can take these.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "735020318"
            ]
          },
          "735020318": {
            "id": "735020318",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Drusus",
            "text": "This is the reward you've won with your pondering. Keep them."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}